        "note": "9,554 rows, the .TECH file. J11: the technology mix per (SCC chain rung, hp bin, model year), filtered to processGroupID = 1 -- the evap rows bin hp differently and would otherwise join in with a full fraction and no exhaust rate.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
